 for additional technology stacks if needed.","order":3,"progress_status":"completed","dependent_files":".gitignore","gmt_create":"2026-02-01T17:38:45.5744994+05:00","gmt_modified":"2026-02-01T17:41:29.6170427+05:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"},{"id":"4fe8c761-cdc9-4ee0-b191-e486c94506b1","repo_id":"b4fead9d-8862-4703-bab6-077e88f24e97","name":"Customization Guide","description":"customization-guide","prompt":"Develop detailed content for customizing the Farely template to meet specific project requirements. Document how to modify the existing ignore patterns in the .gitignore file to accommodate unique development workflows or additional technology stacks. Explain best practices for adding project-specific configurations while maintaining the template's core functionality. Include examples of common customization scenarios such as adding support for additional build tools, development environments, or deployment targets. Address the balance between maintaining template standardization and allowing for project-specific adaptations. Provide guidance on when and how to extend the template for specialized use cases.","order":4,"progress_status":"completed","dependent_files":".gitignore","gmt_create":"2026-02-01T17:38:45.5757354+05:00","gmt_modified":"2026-02-01T17:41:01.2092766+05:00","raw_data":"WikiEncrypted:"}],"wiki_items":[{"catalog_id":"2f57316e-eb3e-4c72-9e35-012ee84161de","title":"Getting Started","description":"getting-started","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"b4fead9d-8862-4703-bab6-077e88f24e97","id":"05e4d59b-b6df-4e77-a447-33660f92a251","gmt_create":"2026-02-01T17:39:34.1291244+05:00","gmt_modified":"2026-02-01T17:39:34.1333054+05:00"},{"catalog_id":"479d3cdf-cf08-4948-90af-59bf5e0344b9","title":"Project Overview","description":"project-overview","extend":"{}","progress_status":"completed","repo_id":"b4fead9d-8862-4703-bab6-077e88f24e97","id":"7391be3b-ecf0-461b-97f6-f69fe08cb8bc","gmt_create":"2026-02-01T17:39:43.5883017+05:00","gmt